A = [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
S: Symmetric Matrix[2, 2] = A + Aᵀ
P: PositiveDefinite Matrix[2, 2] = [[2, 1], [1, 2]]
Q: PositiveDefinite Matrix[2, 2] = P + P
D: Diagonal Matrix[2, 2] = A - A
O: Orthogonal Matrix[2, 2] = identity(2) + identity(2)
L: Symmetric Matrix[2, 2] = [[1, 2], [3, 1]]
# Kept by `+` and `-`.
T: Symmetric Matrix[2, 2] = P + P - identity(2)
E: Diagonal Matrix[2, 2] = 2 * identity(2) - identity(2)
